## Dataset

The augmented histology patch dataset was generated using Roboflow augmentation.

Dataset download link:
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Za3HBidBmNYaowUfPrQYCxOLO6a0Hibt/view?usp=sharing

Augmentation settings:

* Horizontal Flip
* Vertical Flip
* Rotation ±10°
* Resize 224×224
* 2x image generation
